            Buying Guide
          </span>
          <span class="bg-green-500 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
            Updated October 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Best Treadmills <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">for a Garage</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          The most important specification for a garage treadmill is one most listings never show: what the warranty says about garages. Two popular brands we checked void it outright. Here are five machines whose makers do not, or whose build makes the case anyway, and how to keep any treadmill alive in a cold, damp, dusty space.
