          <a href="#what-manuals-say" class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm border border-white/20">
            What the Manuals Say
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- Author & Meta -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-12">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 py-8 border-b border-gray-100">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan" width="48" height="48" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full" />
        <div>
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shaheer-ali-khan-data/" rel="author noopener" target="_blank" class="text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Shaheer Ali Khan</a></p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-tight">Author and lab tester</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block w-px h-8 bg-gray-200"></div>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
          Last Updated: <strong class="text-gray-700">October 15, 2026</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="ml-auto">
          <SocialProof users="2.2k" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose my-10 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-gray-900">On the products below.</strong> We have not tested these
          treadmills, in a garage or anywhere else. On 15 October 2026 we read the current owner's
          manuals Spirit Fitness links from its product pages (revisions dated December 2025 to June
          2026), Spirit's specification sheets and product pages, Life Fitness's Run CX specification
          sheet, and, for comparison, the 2026 owner's manual for the Sole F80, the Bowflex T6 and T9
          owner's manuals and a TRUE Fitness Performance series manual. We cross-checked every
          figure against a large US retailer's listing (Abt), and for the Run CX against an independent
          review as well. A figure appears in a product's specification line only where the sources
          agree; where they disagreed — on incline ranges, belt widths, chest straps, weights and
          dimensions — we left it out and say so. We quote warranty and environment language only
          where we read it ourselves, and only for the model named. Prices are those we saw on 15
          October 2026 and change often, and manuals are revised; confirm the price, the specification
          and the current warranty terms for the exact unit — ideally in writing — before you order.
          We earn a commission if you buy through the Amazon links on this page; it does not change
          which products we list or what we say about them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-8">
      <div class="not-prose bg-orange-50 border border-orange-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mt-0 mb-3">Our Top Picks</h2>
        <ul class="list-none m-0 p-0">
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
