            <a href="#spirit-xt685" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Spirit XT685</a>
            <a href="#spirit-xt685" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
