          <a href="#how-we-chose" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. How We Chose These Treadmills</a>
          <a href="#what-manuals-say" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. What the Manuals Actually Say About Garages</a>
